WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.630
What if it doesn't share equally?

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.270
13 sweets, 3 friends.

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.640
4 each, and 1 left over.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.790
That leftover is the remainder.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:14.016
13 ÷ 3 is 4, remainder 1.
